==History==
2024
*The Valkyrie's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 1/1/2024, in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/1/2024)|January 2024 Update]].
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], added a 15% hitpoint boost to the Evolved Valkyrie.
*On 14/5/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/5/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Valkyrie’s Tornado damage by 11%, and decreased her hitpoints to 110% of the original's (from 115%).
*On 16/12/2024, the [[Version History#2024 Quarter 4 Update (16/12/2024)|2024 Quarter 4 Update]], added a sound effect to the Evolved Valkyrie after death.
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Evolved Valkyrie's hitpoints by 0.09% and her damage by 0.45%.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]] removed the Evolved Valkyrie's hitpoints boost.
*On 1/12/2025, a Balance Update decreased the Evolved Valkyrie's tornado radius by half a tile, from 5.5 down to 5.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Valkyrie's tornado damage by 50%

