==Trivia==
*In Norse mythology, Valkyries collect spirits of the dead to take to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valhalla Valhalla], one of the Norse afterlives. Most depictions show them riding on horseback, however, in Clash Royale, they do not ride horses and instead travel on foot.
*The Valkyrie's Evolution resembles the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Valkyrie Super Valkyrie] from Clash of Clans.
*The Valkyrie was the first {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] to receive a [[Card Evolution]].
*When attacking, the Valkyrie sings opera, which is a reference to the opera called [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Die_Walk%C3%BCre Die Walküre (The Valkyrie)] by [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Wagner Richard Wagner].
*The Valkyrie's Evolution is the subject of 3 [[Emotes]].

